                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1ba5fc8-e232-4c1d-acc8-1e68212f0b48",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6d2af8c-0116-37ea-8fa4-9a0cdfe388c0",
                        "source_sense_id": "47d6a285-be51-3775-a5fd-c6f588758a15",
                        "target_lang_word": "lamp oil",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lamp oil",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6f67342-ae0a-39f8-9311-34f7b096d2cd",
                                        "entry_id": "b74aa2a1-7568-32a5-aec4-6c73e00e6f15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any clean-burning oil used as fuel in an oil lamp."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fb574cd-952c-4f02-922c-d1fb50027513",
                                                "sense_id": "e6f67342-ae0a-39f8-9311-34f7b096d2cd",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: (often synonymous) kerosene"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13f09c76-4f19-4596-909c-e9b52de6796a",
                                                "sense_id": "e6f67342-ae0a-39f8-9311-34f7b096d2cd",
                                                "text": "He was much pleased at the prospect of the oil he would get from him, turned the heavy creature from one side to the other, fondled him like a baby, and assured me he was a \"stunning fat sea-cub,\" which should be welcomed at home for boot-grease and lamp-oil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9fcc7abb-2c9a-4695-8d2c-cdeb8a2cab39",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6d2af8c-0116-37ea-8fa4-9a0cdfe388c0",
                        "source_sense_id": "47d6a285-be51-3775-a5fd-c6f588758a15",
                        "target_lang_word": "kérosène",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kérosène",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7083ea7f-374c-38f9-8d4e-cdca5c345f98",
                                        "entry_id": "06b88568-ef64-30ca-adef-b4ac1fe87f1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mélange d’hydrocarbures produit par raffinage, qui fut longtemps utilisé comme liquide d’éclairage et sert de nos jours surtout comme carburant pour les avions et comme additif dans l'essence d'automobile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af3620e1-2d81-416e-b4dc-d205f4e593a1",
                                                "sense_id": "7083ea7f-374c-38f9-8d4e-cdca5c345f98",
                                                "text": "Je rappelle que la convention de Chicago interdit toute taxation sur le kérosène."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a31545d7-2a95-40b5-a4db-899b9b2c631e",
                                                "sense_id": "7083ea7f-374c-38f9-8d4e-cdca5c345f98",
                                                "text": "La température à laquelle le kérosène brûle est suffisante pour faire perdre à l’acier environ 75 % de sa force."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdd510c9-b936-476d-8bcf-db18c9ad8b51",
                                                "sense_id": "7083ea7f-374c-38f9-8d4e-cdca5c345f98",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, à l'heure creuse, quand la rumeur des boulevards s'intensifie et qu'à la puanteur du kérosène s'ajoute la frénésie des klaxons..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9cb6f70-6c27-429a-8a18-745a18897e8e",
                                                "sense_id": "7083ea7f-374c-38f9-8d4e-cdca5c345f98",
                                                "text": "Le quota de rejet carbone (ou méthane) devrait lui aussi être limité : fumer tue, prévient la loi, sur chaque paquet de cigarette. Brûler du kérosène par caprice tue plus sûrement encore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ade67e0-ba63-4fe8-9fea-fab50fa845d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6d2af8c-0116-37ea-8fa4-9a0cdfe388c0",
                        "source_sense_id": "47d6a285-be51-3775-a5fd-c6f588758a15",
                        "target_lang_word": "queroseno",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "queroseno",
